$ --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ Script: Generate_ICDD_Container.dat
$ Author: Aaron Perez Herrera
$ Description: This code automatically triggers the export of geometric and semantic data and linkage
$              information, as well as the assembly of the ICDD container, in accordance with the ISO
$              21597 standard.
$ --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

$ Export the geometry in IFC format with IFC2x3 Coordination View
$ Elements to change when changing project
$ --in: Path and name of Current project .cdb file
$ --out: Path and name of expected .ifc file generated
+SYS sof_ifcexport.exe --in "C:\Users\aaron\Desktop\Tesis con Gustavo - Structural Export\1. Sofistik Model\Steel Frame - Final\Steel_Frame_Final.cdb" --out "C:\Users\aaron\Desktop\Tesis con Gustavo - Structural Export\3. ICDD pipeline\output\SteelFrame_CV_final.ifc" --view coordination --schema ifc2x3

$ Execute python code for generating the ICDD Container
$ Only change this path if python code changes location
+SYS python "C:\Users\aaron\Desktop\Tesis con Gustavo - Structural Export\3. ICDD pipeline\export_semantic_data.py"
+SYS python "C:\Users\aaron\Desktop\Tesis con Gustavo - Structural Export\3. ICDD pipeline\map_geom_with_sem.py"
+SYS python "C:\Users\aaron\Desktop\Tesis con Gustavo - Structural Export\3. ICDD pipeline\build_link_content_rdf.py"
+SYS python "C:\Users\aaron\Desktop\Tesis con Gustavo - Structural Export\3. ICDD pipeline\build_index_rdf.py"
+SYS python "C:\Users\aaron\Desktop\Tesis con Gustavo - Structural Export\3. ICDD pipeline\pack_icdd.py"
+SYS python "C:\Users\aaron\Desktop\Tesis con Gustavo - Structural Export\3. ICDD pipeline\export_Unity_manifest.py"
